<title>LATVIA: KAIJA, RIGA SHIPYARD ON OFFICIAL LIST NEXT WEEK.</title>
<headline>KAIJA, RIGA SHIPYARD ON OFFICIAL LIST NEXT WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Riga stock exchange said on Friday, that Kaija fish cannery and Riga Shipyard will be included in the bourse's official list from next week.</p>
<p>&quot;According to the board decision, Riga Shipyard will be traded on the official list from May 5 and Kaija from May 6,&quot; the bourse's spokeswoman told Reuters.  </p>
<p>Kaija is currently only traded on the secondary list but had asked to be moved to the official list to join Unibanka, Staburadze and Riga Transport Fleet.</p>
<p>-- Martinsh Gravitis, Riga newsroom +372 721 5240</p>
